<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
    <style>
        :root {

            --orange: #ff9900;
            --black: #000000;
            --card: #111111;
            --text: #ffffff;

        }

        * {

            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;

        }

        html,
        body {

            width: 100%;
            min-height: 100%;

            background: #000000;

            color: #ffffff;

            overflow-x: hidden;

            font-family: "Segoe UI", sans-serif;

        }

        .bg-glow {

            position: fixed;

            inset: 0;

            pointer-events: none;

            z-index: -1;

            background:

                radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%,
                    rgba(255, 153, 0, .14),
                    transparent 30%),

                radial-gradient(circle at 85% 75%,
                    rgba(255, 153, 0, .10),
                    transparent 35%),

                #000000;

        }

        .hero {

            min-height: 50vh;

            display: flex;

            justify-content: center;

            align-items: center;

            padding: 80px;

        }

        .hero-card {

            width: min(1000px, 100%);

            text-align: center;

            padding: 70px;

            background: #0d0d0d;

            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 153, 0, .25);

            border-radius: 25px;

            box-shadow:
                0 0 30px rgba(255, 153, 0, .12);

        }

        .hero-card h1 {

            color: white;

            font-size: 5rem;

            margin-bottom: 20px;

        }

        .hero-card p {

            color: #cccccc;

            font-size: 1.2rem;

            line-height: 1.8;

        }

        .reflection-card {

            background: #111111;

            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 153, 0, .20);

            border-radius: 20px;

            padding: 35px;

            transition: .35s;

        }

        .reflection-card:hover {

            transform:
                translateY(-10px);

            border-color: #ff9900;

            box-shadow:
                0 0 35px rgba(255, 153, 0, .25);

        }

        .reflection-card h2 {

            color: #ff9900;

            margin-bottom: 20px;

        }

        .reflection-card p {

            color: #d0d0d0;

            line-height: 1.9;

        }

        .reflection-tab {

            background: #111111;

            color: white;

            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 153, 0, .25);

            padding: 18px 45px;

            border-radius: 50px;

            cursor: pointer;

            transition: .3s;

        }

        .reflection-tab:hover {

            border-color: #ff9900;

            box-shadow:
                0 0 20px rgba(255, 153, 0, .3);

        }

        .reflection-tab.active {

            background: #ff9900;

            color: black;

            font-weight: 700;

        }

        .icon {

            width: 70px;
            height: 70px;

            border-radius: 50%;

            background:
                rgba(255, 153, 0, .10);

            border:
                1px solid rgba(255, 153, 0, .25);

            color: #ff9900;

            display: flex;

            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;

            font-size: 30px;

            margin-bottom: 20px;

        }

        .reflection-grid {

            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns:
                repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));

            gap: 35px;

        }

        .reflection-content {

            display: none;

        }

        .active-content {

            display: block;

        }

        .tab-container {

            display: flex;

            justify-content: center;

            gap: 25px;

            margin-bottom: 60px;

        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>


    <div class="bg-glow"></div>

    <section class="hero">

        <div class="hero-card">

            <h1>COURSE REFLECTIONS</h1>

            <p>
                Personal takeaways, the hurdles I overcame,
                and the mindset shifts I experienced during
                this semester.
            </p>

        </div>

    </section>

    <section class="reflection-section">

        <div class="tab-container">

            <button class="reflection-tab active" onclick="showSection('webtech', this)">
                WEB TECHNOLOGY
            </button>

            <button class="reflection-tab" onclick="showSection('software', this)">
                SOFTWARE ENGINEERING
            </button>

        </div>

        <!-- WEB TECHNOLOGY -->

        <div id="webtech" class="reflection-content active-content">

            <div class="reflection-grid">

                <div class="reflection-card">

                    <div class="icon">🎓</div>

                    <h2>Learning Outcomes</h2>

                    <p>
                        The most significant outcome was discovering exactly
                        how websites function behind the scenes. I learned
                        frontend development, backend communication,
                        database integration and full-stack architecture.
                    </p>

                </div>

                <div class="reflection-card">

                    <div class="icon">⚠️</div>

                    <h2>Challenges Faced</h2>

                    <p>
                        Understanding asynchronous programming and API
                        communication was the biggest challenge.
                        Learning promises, async/await and state
                        management required significant practice.
                    </p>

                </div>

                <div class="reflection-card">

                    <div class="icon">🔧</div>

                    <h2>Skills Gained</h2>

                    <p>
                        I gained practical experience with HTML, CSS,
                        JavaScript, Node.js, Express, React and MySQL.
                        I also improved debugging and deployment skills.
                    </p>

                </div>

                <div class="reflection-card">

                    <div class="icon">🏗️</div>

                    <h2>Architectural Understanding</h2>

                    <p>
                        I learned how frontend, backend and database
                        layers interact and why separation of concerns
                        is important in scalable systems.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- SOFTWARE ENGINEERING -->

        <div id="software" class="reflection-content">

            <div class="reflection-grid">

                <div class="reflection-card">

                    <div class="icon">📚</div>

                    <h2>Learning Outcomes</h2>

                    <p>
                        Requirement gathering, UML diagrams,
                        project planning and documentation taught
                        me that software engineering begins long
                        before writing code.
                    </p>

                </div>

                <div class="reflection-card">

                    <div class="icon">⚠️</div>

                    <h2>Challenges Faced</h2>

                    <p>
                        Managing scope, deadlines and feature
                        prioritization was difficult initially.
                        Learning to follow structured workflows
                        improved project quality.
                    </p>

                </div>

                <div class="reflection-card">

                    <div class="icon">🛠️</div>

                    <h2>Skills Gained</h2>

                    <p>
                        I became comfortable with SDLC,
                        Agile principles, software testing,
                        documentation and version control
                        using GitHub.
                    </p>

                </div>

                <div class="reflection-card">

                    <div class="icon">👥</div>

                    <h2>Team Collaboration</h2>

                    <p>
                        Working in groups improved communication,
                        task allocation, peer reviews and
                        collaborative problem solving skills.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>

    <script>

        function showSection(id, btn) {

            document
                .querySelectorAll(".reflection-content")
                .forEach(section =>
                    section.classList.remove("active-content")
                );

            document
                .querySelectorAll(".reflection-tab")
                .forEach(tab =>
                    tab.classList.remove("active")
                );

            document
                .getElementById(id)
                .classList.add("active-content");

            btn.classList.add("active");
        }

    </script>
</body>

</html>
